# Friends — game design

Product: [docs/product.md](../../docs/product.md). Skill: [friends-game-design](../skills/friends-game-design/SKILL.md).

## MUST

- Room key = Discord Activity `instanceId` (unique). Host = first joiner unless transferred later.
- Categories: `party` | `family` | `colleagues` | `spicy` only (until product says otherwise).
- Round kinds: `most_likely` | `this_or_that` | `truth` | `challenge`.
- Do not reveal `most_likely` / `truth` answers until the round status is `reveal` or `done`.
- Original prompts only — never paste Kumple’s question bank.

## SHOULD

- One vote per player per round (DB unique).
- Skip is always allowed on `challenge` / `truth` (no shame UX).
